---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Ticker from '../components/Ticker.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-top"><p class="eyebrow">A living record / Johnathan Jonas</p><p class="eyebrow">Observation 001</p></div>
    <h1>LOOK<span>TWICE</span></h1>
    <div class="observation">
      <div class="wave-field" aria-hidden="true"><i class="wave"></i><i class="wave"></i><i class="wave"></i><i class="wave"></i><i class="wave"></i></div>
      <span class="observation-number" aria-hidden="true">001</span>
      <div class="observation-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Current observation</p><h2>The quiet after the dishes are done.</h2><p>The apartment is the same room. The counter is clear. For a few minutes, nothing is asking to be fixed.</p></div>
    </div>
    <Ticker />
  </section>
  <section class="intro">
    <p class="intro-copy">Stories, observations, objects, places, routines, and unfinished work. Not a finished portrait. A record of what keeps earning another look.</p>
    <aside class="current"><p class="eyebrow">Current frame</p><h3>School.<br>Health.<br>Home.</h3><p>Finishing the semester, strengthening daily routines, and making room for a quieter future.</p></aside>
  </section>
  <section class="portals">
    <div class="portals-head"><h2>Enter anywhere.</h2><p>Four relationships to time and attention.</p></div>
    <div class="portal-grid">
      <a class="portal portal-story" href="/story/"><span class="eyebrow">Story / Retrospective</span><h3>What shaped me, and what remains at stake.</h3><p>Begin with the longer arc.</p></a>
      <a class="portal portal-notes" href="/notes/"><span class="eyebrow">Notes / Ongoing</span><h3>Attention is taste.</h3><p>Thoughts before they disappear.</p></a>
      <a class="portal portal-things" href="/things/"><span class="eyebrow">Things / Returning</span><h3>What stays.</h3></a>
      <a class="portal portal-now" href="/now/"><span class="eyebrow">Now / Temporary</span><h3>Present.</h3></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
